{"title":"2018 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2018 AMC 10A #12</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2018 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">2018 AMC 12A #10</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Straightforward_Casework)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Straightforward Casework)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3 by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many ordered pairs of real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> satisfy the following system of equations?\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/8/b58992285436b1813d31a4762ccfd7307d087e7e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} x+3y&amp;=3 \\\\ \\big||x|-|y|\\big|&amp;=1 \\end{align*}\" width=\"104\" height=\"46\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/8/668a1b4307255e720a0afa6005afbcff5a138064.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 1 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B) } 2 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C) } 3 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D) } 4 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E) } 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"353\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can solve this by graphing the equations. The second equation looks challenging to graph, but start by graphing it in the first quadrant only (which is easy since the inner absolute value signs can be ignored), then simply reflect that graph into the other quadrants.\n</p><p>The graph looks something like this:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/5/305e6f8f4c7a9e170253eeb9b7d6c41df6dace78.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((-3,0)--(3,0), Arrows); draw((0,-3)--(0,3), Arrows); draw((2,3)--(0,1)--(-2,3), blue); draw((-3,2)--(-1,0)--(-3,-2), blue); draw((-2,-3)--(0,-1)--(2,-3), blue); draw((3,-2)--(1,0)--(3,2), blue); draw((-3,2)--(3,0), red); dot((-3,2)); dot((3/2,1/2)); dot((0,1)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"248\" />\nNow, it becomes clear that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/e/44eb511c4f725b6b8f6c6a941d77324031885652.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" /> intersection points.\n</p><p>(not the author)The lines in the first quadrant are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/0/fe033362483e74682b80c748590496ee8b986201.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/b/a2b84f3e875eec1b9cab1f5da08e449a91de73fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" /> and we reflect them into all quadrants as all instances of variables are in a context where flipping the sign does not affect the overall expression.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/d/88de73b3bb4592164414272fd69da97dc1e0c358.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+3y=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" /> can be rewritten to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/b/c0b4adc658d91833cd64eee87a8097a3ac1f55c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=3-3y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />. Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/e/5ce4a84127cf042b6c7f601a326ebbbc8b965819.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-3y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in the second equation will give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8182cbe24540085d81a28d26de66abd55c19f050.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$||3-3y|-y|=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"18\" />. Splitting this question into casework for the ranges of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> will give us the total number of solutions. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/f/d7fc8bd87f70c04687e145d72c7b03b4d902f80d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{Case 1:}$\" width=\"59\" height=\"11\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/8/b9845c168b2536a28057556dfc680eef7f658833.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/e/5ce4a84127cf042b6c7f601a326ebbbc8b965819.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-3y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" /> will be negative so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/4/994f93bf824b6050080b9be498d3f263daf929b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|3-3y| = 3y-3.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/6/ed6cbb3cbab587eaf856bd1c98f074e9cd0ad07e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|3y-3-y| = |2y-3| = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"208\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<pre>   Subcase 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/f/76f0395de7ab2f4ad89c0ccd6980eb30d1dcf302.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;\\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"45\" height=\"37\" />\n</pre>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/8/1d8cbfc25f75226a38758b02348a6ab712af5937.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" /> is positive so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/e/b4ea8f6c7bcd9edb72841d7562dcb467186f7c00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y-3 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8db1c24a6c4d0ade195b8b098cfe96a64267735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94b456355fd253a2c0a97c454e856ee4fb1fbd7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3-3(2) = -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<pre>   Subcase 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/6/c568081a876195848640ce1a21b4fb9217933351.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;y&lt;\\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"78\" height=\"37\" />\n</pre>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/8/1d8cbfc25f75226a38758b02348a6ab712af5937.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" /> is negative so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/f/bcf3cde4915a82a464f32ffc80c07225e19e920c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|2y-3| = 3-2y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/d/87dad8c1b2ad5c3debf2c670cf3b9364c11c42f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> and so there are no solutions (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> can't equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />)\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/1/331226e700ae378565242419f911b29b000845c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{Case 2:}$\" width=\"59\" height=\"11\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/234b330118777aba0bee513e3ade547ebd70d845.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />:\nIt is fairly clear that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/4/db43f2c66699f1ec2d1988f8a220b6a09d1c91ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0.$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/9/949308f1d0158c4f33a3154470cc9db508bdb248.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{Case 3:}$\" width=\"59\" height=\"11\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/5/a25d4948a50ef14a700f9f1e2a21293f98ab9636.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/e/5ce4a84127cf042b6c7f601a326ebbbc8b965819.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-3y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" /> will be positive so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/a/7aa5d84eed98a70e3451d59df26d8b11a9a56a72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|3-3y-y| = |3-4y| = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"208\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<pre>   Subcase 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/1/0f175718c546764b43a68d7dd1b3be3c1ba27047.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"49\" height=\"38\" />\n</pre>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d03a548fa969fc95e3c6f9bf0ad514150a0cd27c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-4y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" /> will be negative so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/c/80c93b9ef1159c135b509e04b760a38e1d917a2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4y-3 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/2/e12b6767375342ed57d27678e3ea1cdb97f47e15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/2/f82a0912221c2fd05091c6c2b0537dfbe7dd300b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4y = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />. We already have this solution from Case 2 as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/234b330118777aba0bee513e3ade547ebd70d845.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<pre>   Subcase 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/3/da3f19072f909674257638d9599a60b86376a32a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&lt;\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"49\" height=\"38\" />\n</pre>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d03a548fa969fc95e3c6f9bf0ad514150a0cd27c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-4y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" /> will be positive so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/5/8855d076afc32b7cd78934d608e490fc9fe9b5d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-4y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/2/e12b6767375342ed57d27678e3ea1cdb97f47e15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/f/dcf23bb638ba9a7be15b2f9f2b1c9554c8ce7571.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4y = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/d/72d9ffa7385dfa6d83b977f243e2dee69923bda6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"45\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/3/003bcebc12d2d3dd5107627be5b8f237dff6c147.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />.\nThus, the solutions are: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/d/bdd1344d8f1a306dd635609a6066f92f6bf60099.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-3,2), (0,1), \\left(\\frac{3}{2},\\frac{1}{2} \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"168\" height=\"43\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/e/44eb511c4f725b6b8f6c6a941d77324031885652.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Straightforward_Casework.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Straightforward_Casework)\">Solution 3 (Straightforward Casework)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Straightforward Casework)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/3/1a3dadf4097728fe4b0b54add3ca8a33556e04e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$||x| - |y||$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" /> can take on one of four values where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a859acebdd07c34704648be45c0daf108e2a29d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> (positive, positive), <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/5/fd5c0a0f370ccf9702de26c839b7bffb5f9be88c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> (positive, negative), <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca5c579209fabf64213326bfe0e8c326e10ed2da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x + y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" /> (negative, positive), <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/5/1556de43645a5b97f684c2dc01ecd82dce68acdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x -y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"11\" /> (negative, negative). So we have 4 cases which we solve by cancellation with the two equations from the problem:\n</p><p><b>Case 1: ||x| - |y|| = x+y  </b>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/6/2b68f21d4456251f723b5b9780794891f520a3c0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+3y=3\\]\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/a/90a74b1226dd3fdbfb8d0125cf938debce160302.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+y=1\\]\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/0/ab0e97f9947dc70dd1335ef2b3b59b754c7de0f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y=2 \\Rightarrow y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"125\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ea5b6f6de584d56d19a89cc4923a9d9a5cfa41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/0/9e0bbaf02a7af49455b26148187a93f3c4e91757.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Result: } (0,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Case 2: ||x| - |y|| = x-y</b>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/6/2b68f21d4456251f723b5b9780794891f520a3c0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+3y=3\\]\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/8/6982c9bdf7328885ce37161c95af59b06dc4b0da.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x-y=1\\]\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Subtacting:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/d/ebd5397847955f588f02105c84322ce9991bea65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4y=2 \\Rightarrow y=\\dfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"125\" height=\"37\" /> an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/5/f856f5fcde709763b82304bfe71608016fd4380d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\dfrac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/d/77db7d22945a36014a5458c3536cda00e686831d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Result: } \\left(\\dfrac{3}{2},\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"118\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Case 3: ||x| - |y|| = -x+y</b>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/6/2b68f21d4456251f723b5b9780794891f520a3c0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+3y=3\\]\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/8/1080262042a4cfbd627936298c0f3f9072789503.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-x+y=1\\]\" width=\"87\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Adding: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/c/03cd2b73ee8298dcafc4c348733adf0d49ef01a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4y=4 \\Rightarrow y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"122\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ea5b6f6de584d56d19a89cc4923a9d9a5cfa41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/0/9e0bbaf02a7af49455b26148187a93f3c4e91757.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Result: } (0,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" />. Since this is the same solution as we got in Case 1, we can not count this (otherwise, we would have overcounted).\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Case 4: ||x| - |y|| = -x-y</b>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/6/2b68f21d4456251f723b5b9780794891f520a3c0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+3y=3\\]\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/1/cc1afa726f52060319c8969b8223dcc542e7ecda.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-x-y=1\\]\" width=\"87\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Adding: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/3/d4333121eedeb7e801575ffe6bad8758e3044ccc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y=4 \\Rightarrow y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"122\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/c/2fc52914d6fade6cb0f0f830a05d31585700f7ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-3$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/a/6ca5547493facdc566d3616d9131a7476b31a6e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Result: } (-3,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Answer</b>\n</p><p>We solved each case by elimination (either adding the two equations or subtracting), to obtain three solutions: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/5/6457ca2dcd40dc21d9aa0db18c66bbac9af4d899.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/0/f108bf20b7be118f59968c801cbcf9cfa7da6d4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-3,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/c/d6cf5d1fcfc94677d479df7464b0b60ed3b72ce5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\dfrac{3}{2}, \\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"57\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p>Our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/e/44eb511c4f725b6b8f6c6a941d77324031885652.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Contributors</b>\n</p><p>~trumpeter\n</p><p>~ccx09\n</p><p>~mXxHalo711\n</p><p>~BakedPotato66\n</p><p>~&lt;B+\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Just as in solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we derive the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/9/7e94a59ae5b7feabb18d95916eccc5465f197d14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$||3-3y|-|y||=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" />. If we remove the absolute values, the equation collapses into four different possible values. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/c/94c539b7d76fda4a4785e550d35b8455b3e9f117.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d03a548fa969fc95e3c6f9bf0ad514150a0cd27c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-4y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/8/1d8cbfc25f75226a38758b02348a6ab712af5937.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/2/2327e68800568100edad92de1a0768f411dffe0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4y-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" />, each equal to either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />. Remember that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/f/41f82c87769610c76145fbd8a184a6ebc3836fc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P-Q=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0598b937b7aadfac43e81813ad98b3fac43b89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q-P=-a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />. Because we have already taken <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> into account, we can eliminate one of the conjugates of each pair, namely <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/c/94c539b7d76fda4a4785e550d35b8455b3e9f117.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/8/1d8cbfc25f75226a38758b02348a6ab712af5937.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d03a548fa969fc95e3c6f9bf0ad514150a0cd27c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-4y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/2/2327e68800568100edad92de1a0768f411dffe0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4y-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" />. Find the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/c/d9cf88568796d0eb2ede2c216ab9e3499dd2bdd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-2y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/b/6db55f2727c5ff81d1ed962217fc8f2997326fb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-2y=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"96\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/6/e0652c7b6f90fba333720783180236fe81d15583.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-4y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/3/ed32eaf8883b3862ed4336c6284ee1753123da63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-4y=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"96\" height=\"16\" />. We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/c/d9cf88568796d0eb2ede2c216ab9e3499dd2bdd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-2y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/3/ed32eaf8883b3862ed4336c6284ee1753123da63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-4y=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"96\" height=\"16\" /> give us the same value for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/e/44eb511c4f725b6b8f6c6a941d77324031885652.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~Zeric Hang\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Just as in solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we derive the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/b/c0b4adc658d91833cd64eee87a8097a3ac1f55c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=3-3y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />. Squaring both sides in the second equation gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/6/e56c1c65dbb6001129f56ed3d216f6f580f40d13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+y^2-2|xy|=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"150\" height=\"19\" />. Putting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/b/c0b4adc658d91833cd64eee87a8097a3ac1f55c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=3-3y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" /> and doing a little calculation gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/a/5fa2c772a67867fd30c4291f8f58ae0a1a753b5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10y^2-18y+9-2|3y-3y^2|=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"257\" height=\"19\" />. From here we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/d/1adb8f8ed0625bc0f2ddf1261c829b78d5b4d186.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3y-3y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" /> is either positive or negative.\n</p><p>When positive, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/c/bdc2fc7a4fb4e5d307a5671e8f331b837abf412d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y^2-3y+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" /> and then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/4/b849be3e10b1c9b4bd2ceeace68892730ce6f06f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=1/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3b4834614e5e7e189cb7d621cfb4fb0bd36dd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />.\nWhen negative, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/8/408c06d1d8840b873d830802d10d989d27b9aeb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2-3y+2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" /> and then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/a/40ac4b6f5ab516ac6fe7132ed2fe7a1d77ca02dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3b4834614e5e7e189cb7d621cfb4fb0bd36dd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. Clearly, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> different pairs of values and that gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/e/44eb511c4f725b6b8f6c6a941d77324031885652.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~OlutosinNGA\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/o63EtwelFp0\">https://youtu.be/o63EtwelFp0</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=llMgyOkjNgU&amp;ab_channel=TheBeautyofMath\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=llMgyOkjNgU&amp;ab_channel=TheBeautyofMath</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_3_by_MRENTHUSIASM_.28English-Chinese_Bilingual.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\">Video Solution 3 by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3 by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/9UnTrjcFzxk\">https://youtu.be/9UnTrjcFzxk</a>\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A\" title=\"2018 AMC 10A\">2018 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2018 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a